TITLE 1D transport, 10 cells, 10 shifts, cation exchange
SOLUTION 0 Initial (template)
    pH 7.0
    pe 10.733
    units mol/kgw
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial in all cells
    pH 7.0
    pe 10.733
    units mol/kgw
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

SOLUTION 11 Inflow
    pH 7.0
    pe 10.733
    units mol/kgw
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -print_cells 1
    -print_frequency 10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -simulation true
    -state true
    -solution true
    -time true
    -step true
    -pH true
    -pe true
END
